Package: mahab
Type: Package
Title: Species Distribution Mapping Based on the Mahalanobis Distance
Version: 0.4
Date: 2026-11-14
Authors@R: person("Pierre", "Bady", email = "pierre.bady@gmail.com",
    role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Maps species distributions from an ordinary table of
    environmental variables measured at sites. Each site is scored by its
    Mahalanobis distance to the mean habitat of the presence records
    (Clark et al. 1993). The main function adapts mahasuhab() from the
    'adehabitatHS' package to ordinary data frames.
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0)
Imports: stats, graphics, grDevices
Suggests: robust, adehabitatHS, ade4
License: GPL (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
NeedsCompilation: no
Packaged: 2026-11-14 21:22:41 UTC; root
Author: Pierre Bady [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Pierre Bady <pierre.bady@gmail.com>
